statement:
Let P, n ∈ ℕ, U ⊆ ℝ^P open, T ∈ 𝒟_n(U) (GeometricCurrentOn U n), μ a measure on ℝ^P and Θ : ℝ^P → ℝ. Write ω_n = unitBallVolume n and B_t(z) = ball z t. Assume:
(a) M_W(T) = T.massOn W = μ(W) for every open W ⊆ U;
(b) μ(B_ε(x)) ≠ 0 for every x ∈ spt T and every ε > 0;
(c) for μ-a.e. x: whenever θ' ∈ ℝ and μ(B_ρ(x))/(ω_n·ofReal(ρ^n)) → ofReal(θ') as ρ ↓ 0, θ' ≥ 1;
(d) HasMassDensity T y (Θ(y)) for every y ∈ U;
(e) Θ is upper semicontinuous on U.
Then θ ≥ 1 whenever y ∈ spt T and HasMassDensity T y θ.
